                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "5c8ce0ff-4862-35a7-93d7-25c296dfc4cc",
                        "entry_id": "56f1f0c3-15bf-317c-acea-b750e2856563",
                        "glosses": [
                            "to go crazy"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "1257b319-05dc-4bbe-b57a-a0da3e1e27c8",
                                "sense_id": "5c8ce0ff-4862-35a7-93d7-25c296dfc4cc",
                                "text": "Ему́, впро́чем, бы́ло не бо́лее шести́десяти. Тут вы́шла це́лая исто́рия. Го́да полтора́ наза́д с ним вдруг случи́лся припа́док; он куда́-то пое́хал и в доро́ге помеша́лся, так что произо́шло не́что вро́де сканда́ла, о кото́ром в Петербу́рге поговори́ли.",
                                "translation": "He was not more than sixty, however, but there had been a great to-do with him a year and a half before, when he suddenly had a fit. He was travelling somewhere and went mad on the way, so there was something of a scandal of which people talked in Petersburg.",
                                "english": "He was not more than sixty, however, but there had been a great to-do with him a year and a half before, when he suddenly had a fit. He was travelling somewhere and went mad on the way, so there was something of a scandal of which people talked in Petersburg."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
